          name: "How do I know if a folding mechanism is safe for kids and pets?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Look specifically for a secondary safety pin or lock in addition to the primary latch or hydraulic strut. This second stage prevents the deck from dropping even if the primary lock isn't fully engaged, which matters most in households where small children or pets might bump into a folded, upright unit.",
